== Hairline cracks ==
'''[[phab:T20936]]''': This bug appears also in modern browsers on zooming levels.
{|
|[[File:Hairline crack.svg|299px|thumb|White gap visible at odd px sizes (299px)]]
|[[File:Hairline crack.svg|300px|thumb|Same pic 1px larger rendered (300px)]]
|}
Merging the intersecting paths or slightly overlapping them can work around this issue:
* [https://jakearchibald.github.io/svgomg/ Merge Path tool (svgomg)]
* [https://graphicdesign.stackexchange.com/questions/45611/how-do-i-merge-these-two-objects-in-inkscape-such-that-the-space-in-between-is-g Inkscape path merge]

